<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="chest">Chest</h3>The difference in performance between a variation of our Tier 10 chest and off-piece items is big. Ideally, we would be getting our hands on either of the versions. On paper <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50629/robe-of-the-waking-nightmare">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_77.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Robe of the Waking Nightmare</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50717/sanguine-silk-robes">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_80.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanguine Silk Robes</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51813/robes-of-azure-downfall">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_77.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Robes of Azure Downfall</span></a> can outperform <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50243/dark-coven-robe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_77.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dark Coven Robe</span></a> the 251-item level version bought with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=341/emblem-of-frost">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></span></a>, but that is with the caveat of spending your <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=341/emblem-of-frost">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></span></a> on another slot in order to reach your four-set that you will eventually replace and still need to get <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50243/dark-coven-robe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_77.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dark Coven Robe</span></a> for the chest as you will eventually upgrade it to the 264 or 277 version.<div class="box">
<b>Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44465/scroll-of-enchant-chest-powerful-stats">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_scroll_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scroll of Enchant Chest - Powerful Stats</span></a> &gt; <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=38928/scroll-of-enchant-chest-major-spirit">
