<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="wrist">Wrist</h3>When it comes to bracers this phase, we are blessed with great options. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54582/bracers-of-fiery-night">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_45.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of Fiery Night</span></a>, dropping from the Heroic 25-man version of the raid with an ilvl of 284, is a direct upgrade over <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50686/death-surgeons-sleeves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_47.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death Surgeon's Sleeves</span></a>, replacing spirit with Haste rating. It lacks hit rating, unlike <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50651/the-ladys-brittle-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_44.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Lady's Brittle Bracers</span></a>, so consider this if hit rating is crucial for your current bracers. Other great options are <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50651/the-ladys-brittle-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_44.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Lady's Brittle Bracers</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50686/death-surgeons-sleeves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_47.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death Surgeon's Sleeves</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51872/ether-soaked-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_44.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ether-Soaked Bracers</span></a> depending on your hit requirements. As Alliance you will likely not be able to make full use of all the hit rating on either of the hit bracers, making  <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51872/ether-soaked-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_44.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ether-Soaked Bracers</span></a> the better option. However, as Horde we do not have the 1% additional hit chance from <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=6562/heroic-presence">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_21.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heroic Presence</span></a> making it more likely that we can utilize more of the hit rating on <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50651/the-ladys-brittle-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_44.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Lady's Brittle Bracers</span></a>. The fact that these are so close in performance gives us a lot of flexibility for gearing regarding other item slots that either have or do not have hit rating.<div class="box">
<b>Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=57691/fur-lining-spell-power">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fur Lining - Spell Power</span></a> (<a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=165/leatherworking">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a>) &gt; <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44470/scroll-of-enchant-bracer-superior-spellpower">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_scroll_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scroll of Enchant Bracer - Superior Spellpower</span></a></div>
