<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hands</h3>Hands is one of the slots where not going for Tier 10 is less punishing as a lot of great alternatives exist, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51230/sanctified-dark-coven-gloves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_88.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Dark Coven Gloves</span></a> remains the best in slot but if you get <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50663/gunship-captains-mittens">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_88.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gunship Captain's Mittens</span></a> instead along with Tier 10 pants (to achieve your four-piece bonus) you are looking at roughly equal performance. If you already have a lot of hit rating or another piece with hit rating, you currently cannot make use of due to going over cap then <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50722/sanlayn-ritualist-gloves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_92.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">San'layn Ritualist Gloves</span></a> would be a great option as well.<div class="box">
<b>Gloves Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=54999/hyperspeed-accelerators">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hyperspeed Accelerators</span></a> (<a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=202/engineering">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a>) &gt; <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=38979/scroll-of-enchant-gloves-exceptional-spellpower">
