<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Legs</h3>Legs along with Gloves are the slots where we get to choose whether we go for Tier 10 or one of the alternative drops available. This is with the caveat that if you opt for one to not use Tier 10 you will have to do so in the other slot to guarantee your four-piece set bonus, since good the bonus is. On paper <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50694/plaguebringers-stained-pants">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_kilt_cloth_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Plaguebringer's Stained Pants</span></a> is slightly stronger compared to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51232/sanctified-dark-coven-leggings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_kilt_cloth_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Dark Coven Leggings</span></a> accounting for the fact that you keep your four-piece bonus intact and use the other best available gloves namely <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50663/gunship-captains-mittens">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_88.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gunship Captain's Mittens</span></a> if you opt for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51232/sanctified-dark-coven-leggings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_kilt_cloth_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Dark Coven Leggings</span></a>. The good news is that both pants are heavy on hit rating so there does not change a lot of other gear slots to make either work.<br/>
<br/>Alternatively, if you are high on hit rating already you could opt for either <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49891/leggings-of-woven-death">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_34.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of Woven Death</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51882/kilt-of-untreated-wounds">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_kilt_cloth_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Kilt of Untreated Wounds</span></a> (with the caveat of using Tier 10 gloves for the set bonus).<div class="box">
<b>Pants Spellthread</b>: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41602/brilliant-spellthread">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_astralrecalgroup.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brilliant Spellthread</span></a> &gt; <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41601/shining-spellthread">
