<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Warlock DPS in Phase 4</h2>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="neck">Neck</h3>Most necklaces this phase are incredibly close in performance, this is also a great slot to play around with your hit rating. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50658/amulet-of-the-silent-eulogy">
