<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="rings">Rings</h3>Like the previous Phase, we have many close worthwhile options instead of a clear winner combination. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50664/ring-of-rapid-ascent">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_86.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of Rapid Ascent</span></a> combined with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50398/ashen-band-of-endless-destruction">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_83.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ashen Band of Endless Destruction</span></a> which is rewarded for reaching exalted with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/faction=1156/the-ashen-verdict">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Ashen Verdict</span></a> form the absolute best combination. Either of these can easily be replaced with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50636/memory-of-malygos">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Memory of Malygos</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50614/loop-of-the-endless-labyrinth">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_82.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Loop of the Endless Labyrinth</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50714/valanars-other-signet-ring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_81.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valanar's Other Signet Ring</span></a> (if you account for the hit rating) for equal performance. Most of the other rings listed all perform incredibly close to each other. Another thing of note would be the hit rating.<div class="box">
<b>Ring Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=44636/enchant-ring-greater-spellpower">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Greater Spellpower</span></a> (<a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=333/enchanting">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchanting</span></a>).</div>
