<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons and Offhands for Warlock DPS in Phase 4</h2>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="2-handed-weapons">2-Handed Weapons</h3>The heroic version of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50731/archus-greatstaff-of-antonidas">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_108.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Archus, Greatstaff of Antonidas</span></a> is good, especially if you cannot get your hands on <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50732/bloodsurge-kelthuzads-blade-of-agony">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_150.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bloodsurge, Kel'Thuzad's Blade of Agony</span></a> and the benefit of staves is that you only need to get a single weapon instead of two compared to main hand and off-hand combinations. All other staves however fall off quickly in performance.<div class="box">
<b>Weapon Enchant</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45056/scroll-of-enchant-staff-greater-spellpower">
