<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="1-handed-weapons">1-Handed Weapons</h3>The 284 item level weapons from heroic <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=36597/the-lich-king">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Lich King</span></a> are the biggest upgrades that you can get overall this phase. In the case of one hand this is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50732/bloodsurge-kelthuzads-blade-of-agony">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_150.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bloodsurge, Kel'Thuzad's Blade of Agony</span></a>, the closest alternative is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50731/archus-greatstaff-of-antonidas">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_108.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Archus, Greatstaff of Antonidas</span></a>. The other main-hand weapons fall significantly behind in performance when measured against the 284-item level weapons.<div class="box">
<b>Weapon Enchant</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44467/scroll-of-enchant-weapon-mighty-spellpower">
